# Roadmap

This roadmap covers our objectives from v2.0.0 to v3.0.0
We write only the focus area, not complete work in roadmap.
If the work on that direction is complete, new version may be released for that month.
Every month is accompanied with one release.

---

## 2.1.0

- Workflows improvement
- CLI usage section betterment

## 2.2.0

- Tests improvement and addtion
- Easy and one-command based installation/setup of xLaDe and external tools

## 2.3.0

- Modes separation
- CLI step-by-step output improvement

## 2.4.0

- Metrics development
- Lean 4 wrap up experiment

